From b32733d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] ci: fix Android SDK setup for PyStudio release

The v3 default of android-actions/setup-android requests the removed
"tools" SDK package. Upgrade to v4 and install only platform-tools.

diff --git a/.github/workflows/build.yml b/.github/workflows/build.yml
--- a/.github/workflows/build.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/build.yml
@@ -65,9 +65,11 @@ jobs:
           distribution: temurin
           java-version: "17"
 
       - name: Set up Android SDK
-        uses: android-actions/setup-android@v3
+        uses: android-actions/setup-android@v4
+        with:
+          packages: platform-tools
 
       - name: Install Android SDK packages
         shell: bash
         run: |
